      "sourceText": "0.5°在10 m处对应横向约8.7 cm，在1 m处约8.7 mm；这里只说明角度分格的几何尺度，不是定位精度，也不保证这么细的障碍都能看见。输入点云经过上游筛选与降采样，调小角增量不会增加实际回波。",
      "translatedText": "A 0\\.5° increment corresponds to a lateral extent of about 8\\.7 cm at 10 m and about 8\\.7 mm at 1 m; this only describes the geometric scale of the angular grid, not positioning accuracy, and does not guarantee that obstacles this fine can be seen\\. The input point cloud has undergone upstream filtering and downsampling, so reducing the angular increment will not increase the actual returns\\.",
